Billy "The Great" Hope, the reigning junior middleweight boxing champion, has an
impressive career, a loving wife and daughter, and a lavish lifestyle.

4
00:21:23,478 --> 00:21:29,478
However, when tragedy strikes, Billy hits rock bottom,
losing his family, his house and his manager.

5
